Z||000003||fiero56||03-19-2001||06:27 PM||||I don't have any digital pics. But, I'll dig through my stacks of photos, and see if I find it.<P>As I remember, the car is not factory blue. Don't quote me on it, but I think it is a slightly darker shade of blue, without as much metal flake in the paint. Still a beautiful car. Last time I saw it, it was on one of Ed's lifts "out of the way". I saw the entire underside of it. It has aftermarket exhaust tips, Ansa I think, that look very good. It's been a long time since I saw the car in the sun and up close at eye level, but as I remember it is one nice car.||||reg||1
